The log file fixes involve strictly defining the **JSON Schema** for every log entry (as required by the original `LOG SCHEMA` file) and ensuring the output file adheres to the **JSONL** (JSON Lines) format for auditability and easy processing.

Here is the corrected and mandatory structure for log files, as governed by the rules consolidated in `directives.md` Section 4.2.

-----

## 1\. Canonical Log Entry Schema (`TRAC-Log-Entry.json`)

This JSON Schema defines the mandatory structure and fields for every single log line written to the `.spectrac/logs/` directory.

```json
{
  "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
  "$id": "https://schemas.spectrac.io/TRAC-Log-Entry.json",
  "title": "TRAC Log Entry Schema",
  "type": "object",
  "description": "Structured, machine-readable log entry for audit and traceability.",
  "required": ["ts", "action", "agent", "project_id", "entries"],
  "properties": {
    "ts": {
      "type": "string",
      "format": "date-time",
      "description": "Timestamp in ISO8601 UTC format (e.g., 2025-10-30T05:00:00Z). **Mandatory.**"
    },
    "action": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": ["SESSION-START", "SESSION-END", "CREATE", "UPDATE", "TASK-UPDATE", "ESTIMATE-CALC", "ERROR"],
      "description": "Canonical action type. **Mandatory.**"
    },
    "agent": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Source of the log entry (e.g., 'gemini-agent', 'local-cli')."
    },
    "user": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "User identifier (e.g., 'hannahbellesheart', must not be PII unless essential for audit)."
    },
    "project_id": {
      "type": "string",
      "pattern": "^[A-Z0-9]+-\\d{3}$",
      "description": "The target project ID (e.g., P-001). **Mandatory.**"
    },
    "solution_id": {https://github.com/hannahbellesheart/trac-spec-kit/tree/main/.spectrac/logs
      "type": "string",
      "description": "The overall solution ID (e.g., S-001)."
    },
    "entries": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "The specific payload related to the action (e.g., diffs, status updates, sources)."
    },
    "trace_id": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "A unique request/session ID for tracing across services."
    }
  },
  "additionalProperties": false
}
```

-----

## 2\. Log File Template (JSONL)

The actual log files **MUST** be named using a UTC timestamp (e.g., `20251030_050000Z.log`) and must contain **one complete JSON object per line**, with no commas or other formatting between entries. This ensures the file is **JSONL** (JSON Lines) and is strictly append-only.

**File Location:** `./services/spec-agent/.spectrac/logs/YYYYMMDD_HHMMSSZ.log`

```jsonl
{"ts":"2025-10-30T05:01:15Z","action":"SESSION-START","agent":"gemini-agent","user":"hannahbellesheart","project_id":"P-001","entries":{"prompt_hash":"SHA256-12345ABC","context":"Project P-001 review and fixes."},"trace_id":"b305c48b-3e7d-4a11-a83e-004f12d8a0f1"}
{"ts":"2025-10-30T05:01:22Z","action":"ESTIMATE-CALC","agent":"gemini-agent","user":"hannahbellesheart","project_id":"P-001","entries":{"task_id":"P-001-T-007","confidence":0.85,"rate_bands":{"L":50.00,"S":65.00,"H":85.00},"sources_cited":["https://www.toptal.com/","https://www.upwork.com/"]},"trace_id":"b305c48b-3e7d-4a11-a83e-004f12d8a0f1"}
{"ts":"2025-10-30T05:01:30Z","action":"CREATE","agent":"gemini-agent","user":"hannahbellesheart","project_id":"P-001","entries":{"artifact_type":"requirements.md","affected_ids":["P-001-F-010","P-001-T-012"]},"trace_id":"b305c48b-3e7d-4a11-a83e-004f12d8a0f1"}
{"ts":"2025-10-30T05:01:45Z","action":"TASK-UPDATE","agent":"local-cli","user":"hannahbellesheart","project_id":"P-001","entries":{"task_id":"P-001-T-003","status":"done","duration_minutes":45,"notes":"Code merged to main branch."},"trace_id":"local-session-1"}
{"ts":"2025-10-30T05:02:01Z","action":"UPDATE","agent":"gemini-agent","user":"hannahbellesheart","project_id":"P-001","entries":{"artifact_type":"spectrac-alpha.stp","changed_fields":["current_ids.tasks_current_max"],"diff":"tasks_current_max: P-001-T-011 -> P-001-T-012"},"trace_id":"b305c48b-3e7d-4a11-a83e-004f12d8a0f1"}
```
